description: Observer UI copy goes through i18n catalogs (en, es, de, tr, ru)
globs: observer/**,**/ui/**,**/*.{tsx,jsx,vue,html,json}
alwaysApply: false
---

# Web UI language

- User-visible strings go through **i18n catalogs**. Locales: `en`, `es`, `de`, `tr`, `ru`.
- Do not hardcode English (or any language) in components. Add the key to all five catalogs in the same change.
- Default: browser language, fallback `en`. Language switcher in the cabinet.
- The constitution text the principal typed is not auto-translated. Protocol field names stay English.
- Source comments stay English (`source-code-language.mdc`).
